            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Imagine que tu appelles <code>items.pop()</code> avant d’afficher la longueur. Que montrerait la console ?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" items = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;milk&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;tomato&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;apple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(items.length);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assurez-vous de choisir <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>",
